      "created_at": "2021-02-26T07:59:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I just bought the game from drivethroughrpg and downloaded all the files. Was very happy it came with form fillable hero and villain sheets, but was then disapointed that they dont save any data, they can only be printed out. As i do not have a printer at the moment, does anyone know if thare are any versions of these where you can save the data you put in?</p>",
